013 Rebooked free onto AL712 (dep 08:50 \u2192 arr 17:40).\n- **R-3005 (Rosa Lind, Gold, Business)** \u2013 Rebooked free onto AL712 (dep 08:50 \u2192 arr 17:40).\n- **R-3002 (Theo Park, Silver)** \u2013 AL712 filled with the two Gold passengers first, so rebooked free onto AL706 (dep 08:45 \u2192 arr 17:10).\n- **R-3003 (Basic Economy)** \u2013 Cancelled free of charge, since basic economy fares can't be rebooked.\n- **R-3004** \u2013 Cancelled free of charge per the passenger's note requesting no rebooking.\n\nAll passengers have been notified accordingly.", "type": "text"}], "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 1731, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4330, "output_tokens": 285, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "server_tool_use": null, "service_tier": "standard"}, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "served_model": "claude-sonnet-5", "request_id": "req_011CfWeDw9j7MtNdasJdwDZN"}], "trace_id": "01M3N2T7HMBWHGZSXDT1XZWWJK", "agentlens": {"format": "agentlens/v1", "trace_id": "01M3N2T7HMBWHGZSXDT1XZWWJK", "name": "episode:tools/air_stack_disruption", "started_at": "2026-09-28T22:40:20.532012Z", "ended_at": "2026-09-28T22:40:50.226154Z", "duration_ms": 29694.142, "status": "ok", "attributes": {"episode_id": "tools-air_stack_disruption-01M3N2T7HK7Q0DY39VYENHSCHN", "family": "tools", "task_id": "air_stack_disruption", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "corpus": "agentlens-failure-corpus", "outcome": "pass"}, "cost_usd": 0.088834, "tokens": {"input": 11502, "output": 3016, "cache_read": 8655, "cache_write": 1731}, "spans": [{"span_id": "01M3N2T7HMBZNWFFR226FQK0CT", "trace_id": "01M3N2T7HMBWHGZSXDT1XZWWJK", "parent_span_id": null, "name": "episode:tools/air_stack_disruption", "type": "agent", "status": "ok", "started_at": "2026-09-28T22:40:20.532024Z", "ended_at": "2026-09-28T22:40:50.226142Z", "duration_ms": 29694.118, "attributes": {"episode_id